* alu4_opt.lib  4-bit ALU, transistor level: minimum-PDP cells (transmission-gate XOR, multiplexer, full adder)
* Subcircuit alu4_opt; pins: a_0..a_3, b_0..b_3, s_0..s_2, y_0..y_3, c, v, z, n, vdd, vss
* (index 0 is the least significant bit). Operation select s_2 s_1 s_0:
*   000 ADD   001 SUB   010 INC   011 DEC   100 AND   101 OR   110 XOR   111 NOT (of a)
* Flags: c carry out (1 = no borrow for SUB and DEC), v signed overflow, z result zero,
* n result negative; c and v are 0 for the logic operations.
* 69 cell instances, 402 transistors. Cells used (cells_opt.lib):
*   opt_xor2 x 10, opt_buf x 5, opt_mux2 x 20, opt_fa x 4, opt_nand2 x 5, opt_inv x 17, opt_nor2 x 8
* Requires: .include tsmc018.lib and the cell files named above.

.subckt alu4_opt a_0 a_1 a_2 a_3 b_0 b_1 b_2 b_3 s_0 s_1 s_2 y_0 y_1 y_2 y_3 c v z n vdd vss
